, "position": 12, "revision_id": "4ab6f934-436c-4274-808a-39ae7edeb568", "url_type": "upload", "id": "33ba6857-2a55-479f-9308-e5c4c53d4381", "resource_type": null, "size": null}, {"mimetype": "text/csv", "cache_url": null, "name": "Historic Demand Data 2021", "hash": "", "description": "Historic electricity demand, interconnector, wind and solar outturn data for 2021. Please find a brief summary of some of the columns in the dataset: <br/><br/> ND = National Demand is the sum of metered generation, but excludes generation required to meet station load, hydro storage pumping and interconnector exports <br/><br/> TSD = Transmission System Demand is equal to the ND plus the additional generation required to meet station load, pump storage pumping and interconnector exports ", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-08T19:51:18.838166", "cache_last_updated": null, "url": "https://api.neso.energy/dataset/8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601/resource/18c69c42-f20d-46f0-84e9-e279045befc6/download/demanddata_2021.csv", "datastore_active": true, "format": "CSV", "package_id": "8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601", "created": "2021-02-02T09:20:29.827063", "state": "active", "mimetype_inner": null, "last_modified": "2025-04-08T19:51:19.727410", "position": 13, "revision_id": "c1db9509-89f5-4f6f-966c-46aead9ec960", "url_type": "upload", "id": "18c69c42-f20d-46f0-84e9-e279045befc6", "resource_type": null, "size": null}, {"mimetype": "text/csv", "cache_url": null, "name": "Historic Demand Data 2022", "hash": "", "description": "Historic electricity demand, interconnector, wind and solar outturn data for 2022. Please find a brief summary of some of the columns in the dataset: <br/><br/> ND = National Demand is the sum of metered generation, but excludes generation required to meet station load, hydro storage pumping and interconnector exports <br/><br/> TSD = Transmission System Demand is equal to the ND plus the additional generation required to meet station load, pump storage pumping and interconnector exports ", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-08T19:52:20.662715", "cache_last_updated": null, "url": "https://api.neso.energy/dataset/8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601/resource/bb44a1b5-75b1-4db2-8491-257f23385006/download/demanddata_2022.csv", "datastore_active": true, "format": "CSV", "package_id": "8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601", "created": "2022-02-02T09:30:10.023984", "state": "active", "mimetype_inner": null, "last_modified": "2025-04-08T19:52:21.391966", "position": 14, "revision_id": "6378ecab-3da5-4ef8-8a08-c5bf4cb093a7", "url_type": "upload", "id": "bb44a1b5-75b1-4db2-8491-257f23385006", "resource_type": "csv", "size": null}, {"mimetype": "text/csv", "cache_url": null, "name": "Historic Demand Data 2023", "hash": "", "description": "Historic electricity demand, interconnector, wind and solar outturn data for 2023. Please find a brief summary of some of the columns in the dataset: <br/><br/> ND = National Demand is the sum of metered generation, but excludes generation required to meet station load, hydro storage pumping and interconnector exports <br/><br/> TSD = Transmission System Demand is equal to the ND plus the additional generation required to meet station load, pump storage pumping and interconnector exports", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-08T19:54:08.479540", "cache_last_updated": null, "url": "https://api.neso.energy/dataset/8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601/resource/bf5ab335-9b40-4ea4-b93a-ab4af7bce003/download/demanddata_2023.csv", "datastore_active": true, "format": "CSV", "package_id": "8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601", "created": "2023-02-02T09:27:48.015733", "state": "active", "mimetype_inner": null, "last_modified": "2025-04-08T19:54:08.935442", "position": 15, "revision_id": "4d84162b-4831-4e17-8c78-93175a398d35", "url_type": "upload", "id": "bf5ab335-9b40-4ea4-b93a-ab4af7bce003", "resource_type": "csv", "size": null}, {"mimetype": "text/csv", "cache_url": null, "name": "Historic Demand Data 2024", "hash": "", "description": "Historic electricity demand, interconnector, wind and solar outturn data for 2024. Please find a brief summary of some of the columns in the dataset: <br/><br/> ND = National Demand is the sum of metered generation, but excludes generation required to meet station load, hydro storage pumping and interconnector exports <br/><br/> TSD = Transmission System Demand is equal to the ND plus the additional generation required to meet station load, pump storage pumping and interconnector exports ", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-08T19:55:41.500885", "cache_last_updated": null, "url": "https://api.neso.energy/dataset/8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601/resource/f6d02c0f-957b-48cb-82ee-09003f2ba759/download/demanddata_2024.csv", "datastore_active": true, "format": "CSV", "package_id": "8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601", "created": "2024-02-02T09:27:48.700276", "state": "active", "mimetype_inner": null, "last_modified": "2025-04-08T19:55:41.954513", "position": 16, "revision_id": "7d7b328c-80ca-49a4-beb1-3aa221dcf7d5", "url_type": "upload", "id": "f6d02c0f-957b-48cb-82ee-09003f2ba759", "resource_type": "csv", "size": null}, {"mimetype": null, "cache_url": null, "name": "Historic Demand Data 2025", "hash": "", "description": "Historic electricity demand, interconnector, wind and solar outturn data for 2025. Please find a brief summary of some of the columns in the dataset: <br/><br/> ND = National Demand is the sum of metered generation, but excludes generation required to meet station load, hydro storage pumping and interconnector exports <br/><br/> TSD = Transmission System Demand is equal to the ND plus the additional generation required to meet station load, pump storage pumping and interconnector exports ", "metadata_modified": "2026-06-09T13:25:06.668855", "cache_last_updated": null, "url": "https://api.neso.energy/dataset/8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601/resource/b2bde559-3455-4021-b179-dfe60c0337b0/download/demanddata_2025.csv", "datastore_active": true, "format": "CSV", "package_id": "8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601", "created": "2025-02-02T09:20:13.550086", "state": "active", "mimetype_inner": null, "last_modified": "2026-06-09T13:25:07.456371", "position": 17, "revision_id": "66926ce0-11c0-4a14-9f45-d30c99402e01", "url_type": "upload", "id": "b2bde559-3455-4021-b179-dfe60c0337b0", "resource_type": null, "size": null}, {"mimetype": null, "cache_url": null, "name": "Historic Demand Data 2001", "hash": "", "description": "Historic electricity demand, interconnector, wind and solar outturn data for 2001. Please find a brief summary of some of the columns in the dataset: <br/><br/> ND = National Demand is the sum of metered generation, but excludes generation required to meet station load, hydro storage pumping and interconnector exports <br/><br/> FORECAST_ACTUAL_INDICATOR = Indication of whether data is out-turn (A) or forecast (F) <br/><br/> I014_ND = Equivalent to ND but calculated using settlement metered generation data from the I014 file where available <br/><br/> TSD = Demand is equal to the ND plus the additional generation required to meet station load, pump storage pumping and interconnector exports <br/><br/> I014_TSD = Equivalent to TSD (above), but calculated using settlement metered generation data from the I014 file where available", "metadata_modified": "2025-06-20T12:18:38.895083", "cache_last_updated": null, "url": "https://api.neso.energy/dataset/8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601/resource/e8608e9a-f56c-457f-b9e7-bfffcfd19731/download/demanddata_2001.csv", "datastore_active": true, "format": "CSV", "package_id": "8f2fe0af-871c-488d-8bad-960426f24601", "created": "2025-06-20T08:35:31.258402", "state": "active", "mimetype_inner": null, "last_modified": "2025-06-20T08:35:31.018121", "position": 18, "revision_id": "70d57104-368d-47a6-b470-b65b1993169e", "url_type": "upload", "id": "e8608e9a-f56c-457f-b9e7-bfffcfd19731", "resource_type": null, "size": null}, {"mimetype": null, "cache_u